# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# /download/mac is the link the page and any post or email should use. This file is the single
# place the current version appears, so cutting a release means editing one line here rather
# than hunting through markup for a hardcoded filename.
#
# 302 rather than 301 on purpose: the target moves with every release, and a permanent redirect
# would be cached by browsers long after it stopped being true.
#
# The DMG itself is served from the update feed, which already hosts the notarized, stapled
# artifact that Sparkle hands to existing installs. Serving a second copy from here would mean
# two files that can drift apart, and the one people download first would be the one nobody
# checks.

/download/mac    https://updates.getcollateral.xyz/Collateral-1.2.1.dmg   302
/buy             https://buy.getcollateral.xyz                            302
